Error [E0215]: `SharedGuard.map` needs a stored field projection
  --> tests/ui/shared_guard_computed_map.jet:9:20
    |
  9 |     _ :: guard.map(value -> value.attack)
    |                    ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: A mapped guard must keep a stable stored place inside the value protected by the original lock; computed fields are values, not places
 Fix: Write a direct projection such as `guard.map(value -> value.field)`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0215
